              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "la télécommande — \"remote control\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Personne ne trouve la télécommande. Nobody can find the remote control."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Informally also la zapette."
            }
          ]
        },
