          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "la télécommande is built from Greek tēle \"far\" and commande \"command\", which goes back, through commander, to Latin commendāre \"to entrust\", built on mandāre \"to entrust, to order\" (Lewis & Short)."
            }
          ]
